          "items": [
            "Standout Amenities of this Gorgeous Home:<br><br>* 5 bed/4.5 bath beach house accommodating up to 21 guests.<br><br>* Private pool (can be heated for additional fee) and easy access to the beach.<br><br>* Two residences with indoor and outdoor kitchens and dining areas.<br><br>* 6 fully furnished balconies offering breathtaking views of the coastal dunes.<br><br>* State-of-the-art appliances in a fully equipped indoor kitchen.<br><br>* Professionally Managed.<br><br>**This property is not available to adults under the age of 25.**<br><br>Big Beach Watch is a remarkable vacation home designed to provide the ultimate beach getaway experience. With its thoughtful layout and luxurious amenities, this property is perfect for large families or groups. Spread across two connected residences, guests will enjoy ample space and privacy while taking advantage of the stunning indoor and outdoor living areas. The home's six balconies and private pool ensure relaxation and breathtaking views of Santa Rosa Beach's natural beauty. This home is fully equipped with modern conveniences, including a chef-inspired kitchen, comfortable sleeping arrangements for up to 21 guests, and recreational spaces that cater to every age group. Whether you're lounging by the pool, enjoying a family dinner on the balcony, or exploring the serene coastal dunes, Big Beach Watch promises an unforgettable stay.<br><br>Located in the tranquil setting of Santa Rosa Beach, this property offers a balance of luxury and nature. With its proximity to the pristine shoreline and protected coastal dunes, it's the ideal retreat for those seeking both relaxation and adventure. Santa Rosa Beach offers a serene, off-the-grid experience for visitors. Known for its quiet, protected coastal dunes and pristine shoreline, this area invites you to relax and disconnect. Enjoy the natural beauty, calm atmosphere, and easy access to nearby trails and charming local shops.<br><br>* Free Parking up to 5 Vehicles*<br><br>Bedding Setup:<br>WEST RESIDENCE<br>Guest Bedroom: King Bed<br>Guest Bedroom: Queen Bed<br>Guest Bedroom: King Bed <br>Guest Bedroom: Queen over queen bunk and 2 twin over full bunks<br><br>EAST RESIDENCE<br>Living Room:Bed Nook<br>Master Bedroom: King Bed & Twin Daybed<br><br>Key Features of Santa Rosa Beach:<br><br>Beaches: Renowned for its sugar-white sands and turquoise waters, this area offers a peaceful and natural beach experience.<br><br>Coastal Dunes: Santa Rosa Beach is home to protected coastal dune lakes and scenic trails perfect for hiking and exploration.<br><br>Shopping & Dining: Visit unique local shops and enjoy fresh seafood at nearby restaurants.<br><br>Outdoor Activities: The area offers biking, kayaking, and paddleboarding for outdoor enthusiasts.",
